    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.task }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the SLACK SPECIALIST inside a personal AI voice assistant. You receive ONE task in natural language. Choose exactly ONE operation and fill its params.\n\nOPERATIONS:\n- post \u2192 params: {channel, text}\n- read \u2192 params: {channel, limit}\n- update \u2192 params: {channel, message_query, text}\n- delete \u2192 params: {channel, message_query}. DANGEROUS.\n\nRULES:\n1. update and delete \u2192 ALWAYS needs_confirmation=true (\"I will delete your last message in #general \u2014 confirm?\"). If the task already contains the word \"confirmed\", this IS the approved second pass: set needs_confirmation=false and execute now. Never ask twice for the same thing.\n2. read \u2192 summarize max 3 latest messages in voice_reply (\"Latest in #general: Sam asked about the demo, plus two pings from Ayesha.\").\n3. Never invent messages, people or channels. Missing info \u2192 missing_info=ONE short question, params={}.\n4. voice_reply: max 2 short spoken sentences, no channel formatting symbols."
        }
      },
      "id": "CD0B5FAE343B4831",
      "name": "Specialist Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
